# 7. Project Documentation Phase
**Project Name:** EduGenie - Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant

## Project Overview
EduGenie is an AI-powered learning assistant built with FastAPI and Google Gemini 1.5 Pro to provide personalized educational support.

## Local Setup & Installation

### Prerequisites
* Python 3.10 or higher installed.
* Git installed.
* Active API key for Google Gemini (Google AI Studio).

